sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Strategy
  participant B as TSD Bridge
  participant P as Portfolio/Allocator
  participant R as Risk Policy
  participant O as Adopted OMS/EMS
  participant E as Execution Engine
  participant X as Broker/Paper Venue
  participant U as TSD UI
  S->>B: TargetPositionIntent(BTCUSDT=0.20)
  B->>P: Read position/open orders/valuation
  P-->>B: Current 0.18, delta +0.02
  B->>R: Preview target and constraints
  R-->>B: Approved / modified / rejected
  B->>O: Approved target + policy version
  O->>E: Derived BUY 0.02 MARKET plan
  E->>X: Submit paper/live order
  X-->>E: Ack / partial fill / fill
  E-->>B: Order, fill, position, P&L events
  B-->>U: Correlated lifecycle timeline
